{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>2025-26 中國手球超級聯賽男子組第四階段總決賽第三日比賽今午（25日）在馬鞍山體育館上演：香港面對去年奪得全運會季軍的北京，上半場曾一度領先3分， 半場以17:19落後；惟下半場後勁不繼，加上輪換部分球員，最終以10分之差告負。港隊休息一天後，將於周二（27日）下午五時迎戰應屆全運會冠軍江蘇。<br/><br/>圖片、文字：<a href=\"https://gongzuknaaphaam.com/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">港足吶喊</a></p>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/6E4A3364-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/6E4A3432-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/6E4A3489-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<p>今場獨取9分的港隊左副連潤滔直言，北京是傳統勁旅，「上半場可以與他們拉開到只差兩分，其實很神奇。有幾場賽事都希望一拼，有些新戰術亦想試一試。」他完場後手持揚聲器帶領打氣及答謝球迷支持，又透露是第一次這樣做：「真的嚇死我！全運會時是『輝仔』（隊長謝永輝）做得比較多，最主要是想跟球迷說聽到他們的打氣聲。下半場最後15分鐘，無論意志還是體能都真的很疲累，是靠觀眾的支持令我繼續撐下去。」</p>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/6E4A3631-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/6E4A3660-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/6E4A3677-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<p>港隊眾將賽事期間需兼顧工作　黃靈聰：早上才教完波</p>\n<p>不少香港隊成員經歷去年辭職備戰全運會後，已重投日常工作。今場勇救對手「七公尺罰球」、賽後奪得「本場最佳運動員」的守門員黃靈聰，更指今早要先帶領其執教的手球校隊練習，下午才到球場。</p>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/6E4A3704-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/6E4A3849-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/6E4A3862-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/6E4A3883-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<p>身兼手球和健身教練的連潤滔，亦表示昨午要請假比賽：「想維持手球生涯需要取捨，只能說我（對手球）的熱愛勝於事業。（需要上班）反而較舒服，當然工作一定累，但太緊張亦會影響狀態。我有時會用前一晚比賽的經驗去教波，也是一種調整自己心態的方法。」</p>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/6E4A3946-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/6E4A4004-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/6E4A4038-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/6E4A4080-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<p>認識<a href=\"https://gongzuknaaphaam.com/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">「港足吶喊」</a></p>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"237\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/Payme-500x237.png\" width=\"500\"/></figure>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:20:30.834988+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":598,"images":15,"source":"The Collective HK","fallback":"rss-http-error","origin":"wordpress-public-posts","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T14:28:43+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T08:18:10.131137+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T04:13:25.539028+00:00","content_hash":"071f41043bd5fb4d9c890cd7ed83d9905bdba0942c57c685c98ac096cdad2d16","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 520","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}